But here’s the gaming mechanism:

Teams can steal techniques from teams that beat them.

If Dreamer repeatedly beats Pantheon on novelty, Pantheon acquires controlled mutation.

If Compiler beats Golden Horde on repeated tasks, those formations get compiled.

If Minimalists discover that half a Seal can disappear without performance loss, ZPC absorbs the deletion.

If Hologram survives context loss better than Semantic Hyperlinks, the Semantic Genome becomes redundantly encoded.

